---
/* Compact, left-aligned introduction on white. */
---

<section id="why-hood" class="section bg-surface">
  <div class="container-page">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Why HOOD</span>

    <div class="mt-2.5 max-w-[60rem]">
      <h2 class="h-section max-w-[24ch]" data-reveal style="--reveal-i:1">
        Your community already has enough to manage.
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-4" data-reveal style="--reveal-i:2">
        <p class="intro-copy text-ink">
          Pools need to be staffed. Common areas need attention. Small
          maintenance and cleanup jobs still have to get handled.
        </p>

        <p class="body-copy mt-3">
          HOOD Community Services helps HOAs handle the everyday work that keeps
          a community running. From pool staffing and management to cleanups,
          hauling, power washing, and other community needs, we’re here to make
          those responsibilities easier to manage.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
